# Allowlist: ignore everything at the top level, then re-add what we track.
# NOTE: the pattern is "/*", not "*" — "*" matches at every depth, so it would
# re-ignore the contents of every directory re-added below.
/*

!.gitignore
!README.md
!DEPENDENCIES.md

!btop/
!controller-wofi.py
!eww/
!fastfetch/
!fish/
!hypr/
!kitty/
!mako/
!matugen/
!pics/
!rofi/
!swaylock/
!waybar/
!wofi/
